I'm gonna bring my Ben and Jerry's,

00:26:08.960 --> 00:26:11.980
like Christy's got this
Ben and Jerry's stash, man.

00:26:11.980 --> 00:26:14.040
Even before we got to the
beach, like we brought a cooler

00:26:14.040 --> 00:26:15.720
