00:26:15.720 --> 00:26:18.690
So like, of course we're
watching some Survivor,

00:26:18.690 --> 00:26:21.840
once the Neals start,
the Neals don't stop.

00:26:21.840 --> 00:26:23.090
Right, still on Survivor...

00:26:23.090 --> 00:26:25.400
Like season after season
after season, back to back,

00:26:25.400 --> 00:26:27.970
we're just watching
it, 'cause, I told you,

