there's some stuff that

00:27:31.300 --> 00:27:34.080
I don't like that y'all can
have, but this is my pint,

00:27:34.080 --> 00:27:35.210
and I'm eating out of it.

00:27:35.210 --> 00:27:36.260
One pint for the week?

00:27:36.260 --> 00:27:38.443
I mean that's not going that hard.

