Interesting.

00:27:57.131 --> 00:27:58.780
Like I actually did, yeah.

00:27:58.780 --> 00:27:59.613
I weighed.

00:28:01.260 --> 00:28:03.800
'Cause I'm pretty consistent in my weight,

