Don't share that with anybody.

00:28:26.950 --> 00:28:27.783
Yeah.

00:28:27.783 --> 00:28:29.770
The bloody Ben and Jerry's is dad's.

00:28:29.770 --> 00:28:33.870
And I'm taking the last
bite out of my mouth

00:28:33.870 --> 00:28:35.470
and I'm realizing...

