00:29:45.150 --> 00:29:46.900
The mouth has a lot of capillaries.

00:29:46.900 --> 00:29:48.550
I mean, I had to run in there,

00:29:48.550 --> 00:29:50.340
I mean, I was like, man, am I gonna faint?

00:29:50.340 --> 00:29:51.660
I'm not gonna faint, I'm not gonna faint.

00:29:51.660 --> 00:29:52.910
I just grabbed a paper towel,

00:29:52.910 --> 00:29:55.120
I rolled it up like a cigar
and I put it in the edge

00:29:55.120 --> 00:29:59.340
of my mouth like gauze, and
then we finished Survivor.

00:29:59.340 --> 00:30:00.467
We finished Survivor.

00:30:00.467 --> 00:30:03.330
We had to pause it for dad to save himself

00:30:03.330 --> 00:30:04.370
