00:30:04.370 --> 00:30:06.626
Yeah, so, I mean...

00:30:06.626 --> 00:30:07.730
But you could still surf.

00:30:07.730 --> 00:30:10.336
Probably would have had
eight if it wasn't for that.

00:30:10.336 --> 00:30:12.344
You could still surf
