00:39:19.219 --> 00:39:20.947
Drag his butt out there.

00:39:20.947 --> 00:39:24.830
I was like, we'll do this differently,

00:39:24.830 --> 00:39:29.830
it was my fault, well,
I screwed up, you know,

00:39:30.550 --> 00:39:33.720
I got over aggressive and
then my response is where

00:39:33.720 --> 00:39:34.822
I really screwed up,

