so I was like, basically,

00:40:37.790 --> 00:40:38.750
let's have a do over.

00:40:38.750 --> 00:40:39.860
And you know what?

00:40:39.860 --> 00:40:43.554
After a few minutes, he was like...

00:40:43.554 --> 00:40:44.640
Oh the same day?

00:40:44.640 --> 00:40:45.870
Let's try it.

00:40:45.870 --> 00:40:48.350
So yeah, like 20 minutes
