And I'm saying this to Christy.

00:42:10.610 --> 00:42:12.090
In the Pacific Ocean.

00:42:12.090 --> 00:42:14.270
I'm like where are my glasses?

00:42:14.270 --> 00:42:16.004
She was looking at me
like why are you asking me

00:42:16.004 --> 00:42:17.977
