00:42:17.977 --> 00:42:22.977
And I'm like, my glasses, I had a speaker,

00:42:24.212 --> 00:42:28.570
the speaker had a case, cause
I didn't have a glasses case,

00:42:28.570 --> 00:42:32.590
I took the speaker out, 'cause
we were playing the speaker

00:42:32.590 --> 00:42:36.330
on the beach, and I put
my glasses in that case.

00:42:36.330 --> 00:42:40.849
And then you guys packed everything up.

00:42:40.849 --> 00:42:41.682
It's their fault.

00:42:41.682 --> 00:42:42.920
So that I could get...

00:42:42.920 --> 00:42:43.900
It's not your fault.

00:42:43.900 --> 00:42:45.800
The big stuff back up there,

00:42:45.800 --> 00:42:50.573
so did anybody see my glasses?

00:42:51.440 --> 00:42:53.240
It's like why are you asking me?

00:42:53.240 --> 00:42:55.710
I'm like, well, because
you guys are the ones

00:42:55.710 --> 00:42:57.140
who packed everything up.

00:42:57.140 --> 00:42:58.508
Right.

00:42:58.508 --> 00:42:59.960
And cause we're back at the house now,

00:42:59.960 --> 00:43:03.650
we've driven the, I don't know,
10 minutes back or whatever.

00:43:03.650 --> 00:43:07.480
And so, I'm mad.

00:43:07.480 --> 00:43:08.410
I'm very mad.

00:43:08.410 --> 00:43:12.520
I'm like, I need my glasses to see,

00:43:12.520 --> 00:43:14.750
I have contacts, I have
enough contacts to last

00:43:14.750 --> 00:43:18.320
