But you need the glasses.

00:43:19.157 --> 00:43:21.250
But who's Link without glasses?

00:43:21.250 --> 00:43:24.730
It's like, I bought a
second pair of my glasses.

00:43:24.730 --> 00:43:25.563
Well, there you go.

00:43:25.563 --> 00:43:27.579
Identical to my current pair

00:43:27.579 --> 00:43:30.143
