00:43:30.143 --> 00:43:33.680
I would have em to be Link.

00:43:33.680 --> 00:43:34.513
Yeah.

00:43:34.513 --> 00:43:36.220
I'm the guy, I'm the one with the glasses.

00:43:36.220 --> 00:43:37.313
Well, don't be so attached to it,

00:43:37.313 --> 00:43:39.536
I mean, I'm getting older by the second.

00:43:39.536 --> 00:43:43.620
Right, I mean, I'm the one
with the gray hair and glasses.

00:43:43.620 --> 00:43:45.320
You're currently the one with glasses.

00:43:45.320 --> 00:43:48.160
The only one with glasses.

00:43:48.160 --> 00:43:51.100
But those glasses, my back
up glasses were stolen

00:43:51.100 --> 00:43:53.750
two years ago from my car
in my own freaking driveway.

00:43:53.750 --> 00:43:54.583
Oh man.

00:43:54.583 --> 00:43:57.010
Screw you, person who did that.

00:43:57.010 --> 00:43:59.050
They're prescription, you
can't use them anyway.

00:43:59.050 --> 00:44:00.100
Yeah, jackass.

00:44:00.100 --> 00:44:01.460
And I never got em replaced

00:44:01.460 --> 00:44:03.185
