00:44:05.329 --> 00:44:06.162
Christy's sunglasses.

00:44:06.162 --> 00:44:07.320
Those are prescription...

00:44:07.320 --> 00:44:08.540
Not my sunglasses.

00:44:08.540 --> 00:44:13.540
So, I'm mad, I'm like,
they gotta be on the beach,

00:44:13.610 --> 00:44:18.610
so I go back, I drive
back, and I'm just so mad,

00:44:20.220 --> 00:44:22.853
I'm like this is not vacation.

00:44:24.380 --> 00:44:26.730
And then I had to find a place to park.

00:44:26.730 --> 00:44:28.273
But did anybody say something like,

